### Get trend data points
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/trends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get trend data points - 7 day range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/trends?range=7d
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get active patterns
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/trends/patterns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get thread for an entry (use a real entry id that has been AI processed)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/entries/ad6542ad-ef74-437e-a565-0b4be0189c0e/thread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a message in the thread
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/entries/ad6542ad-ef74-437e-a565-0b4be0189c0e/thread/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "I just feel like it never changes no matter how many times I bring it up."
}


